  "details": "<p>Senwosret III is also associated with a\u00a0pyramid complex north-east of the\u00a0Red Pyramid\u00a0of\u00a0Dashur. It is possible that the pyramid complex at Dashur was a cenotaph while the pharaoh was actually buried in the Abydos complex.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-15\"><br /></sup></p>",
